        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w07.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "相談室の長机に、手帳と聞き取り用の紙を並べた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "インクは新しくした。今日は、監督の初仕事をやり直す日。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "決めたことはひとつ。所有の欄より先に、本人の希望の欄を埋める。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "契約でどう動かせるかは、その後でいい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "一人目の希望は、長かった。記入欄が三行で尽き、裏面に続き、別紙に達した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "希望というより、長い長い年月の積み残しだった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "途中で気づいた。希望を聞かれた側は、どんどん姿勢が良くなる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "長生きの人の背筋が伸びる音、この日初めて聞いた。耳が、思わずそっちを向いた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "二人目の希望は、短すぎた。「特になし」そのまま書くと、なぜか手が止まる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "欄外に小さく書き足した。「(継続して聞き取り)」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "三人目は、希望より先に条件を出してきた。「昼寝の時間は、死守する」書いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "大きく書いた。守れる希望から守るのが、うちの方針。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "聞き取りの合間に、負債の頁を開いた。照会中だった数字が、数字になっていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "桁を、三回数えた。三回とも、同じ桁。多い方に。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それでも不思議と、怖くなかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "希望欄の束が、隣にあるから。負債は数字で、希望は文字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "文字は、書けば増える。私にも、増やせる側のもの。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夕方、計測係くんが、おずおずと再計測に来た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「す、数値、上がってます。何も、してないのに」何かは、した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "希望を聞いた。——それだけで強くなる人たちと、働いてる。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ノノさんが小声で教えてくれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「信じてもらうと強くなるの、この街の人たち、昔からなんです」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「だから賭けが、あんなに熱いんですけどね」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.010d",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.010d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……この街の賭けの熱気の正体、いま少し分かった気がする。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.direction.mimi.shift.011",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w07.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "聞き取りの束で手帳は倍の厚さ、留め紐が閉まらない。ノノさんが太い紐をくれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「育つ手帳は、いい手帳です」鞄が重い。今度は、嫌な重さじゃなかった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰りぎわ、掲示板に新しい貼り紙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「最上級リーグ 対戦表(改)」うちの初戦の相手の欄に、長い名前がある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.line.012c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w07.line.012c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "紙の幅に収まらず、読めたのは最後の二文字だけ——「の海」とだけ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w07.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
